[gd_scene load_steps=14 format=3]

; zone_ember_hollow — the first village and the ground around it (WLD-06).
;
; The layout the whole world is built on: a walled village that is safe ground, two gates, and
; six camps ringed around it. The distances are not taste — ZoneRoot.Audit measures each camp
; against the leash of the creatures it produces, so the hopper camps sit nearest because a
; hopper gives up soonest, and the sprite camps furthest because a sprite follows longest.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id and nothing else, and
; every creature here is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is coordinates.

